  "label": "gun gesture mapped to police gun",
  "description": "The visual metaphor of the hand making a gun gesture is mapped onto the textual reference to 'a cop pulls his gun on you'. The hand gesture represents the gun mentioned in the text, creating an analogical mapping where the visual element (hand gesture) stands in for the textual entity (police gun). This mapping is central to the meme's visual joke, implying a 'gotcha' moment for white individuals when confronted by police.",
